    <textTemplates>
        <name>BuyoutClientEmailTemplate</name>
        <isViewedAsPlainText>false</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>&lt;p&gt;Dear {!$Record.Client_Full_Name__c},&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Thank you for speaking with our team today regarding your current debt situation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;After reviewing your file, we have determined that our traditional debt relief program will not be a good fit for you and your business at this time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;However, we do have a strong alternative approach that may be a good fit for your business. This option is handled by a specialized team and has been very effective for clients in similar situations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We have reassigned your file to Zak, a Senior Advisor who handles these specific types of cases. He will be reaching out to you within the next 24 hours to discuss this alternative solution.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you no longer wish to receive emails from us, you may &lt;a href=&quot;{!UnsubscribeUrl}&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;unsubscribe &lt;/a&gt;at any time&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Best regards,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Coastal Debt Resolve Team&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;6700 N Andrews Ave, Suite 500&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fort Lauderdale, FL 33309&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You are receiving this email because you previously spoke with our team regarding your business debt.&lt;/p&gt;</text>
    </textTemplates>
